玗進：♪ Chestnuts roasting on an open fire ♪

236
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:18,750
玗進：♪ Chestnuts roasting on an open fire ♪
立于：「What you gonna...」

237
00:19:18,750 --> 00:19:23,100
立于：「What you gonna be for Halloween?（你們萬聖節要扮什麼？）」

238
